{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-7","storyName":"冷月","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"花火大会、继位仪式……一切开始之前，更纱为三船送上了一份大礼：她劫持了金石台的信号，向整座城市播出北院入侵的紧急警报，使得三船焦头烂额。以此为契机，所有人都开始了自己的行动。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["三船","澪","欣喜的路人","冷静的路人","电视里的声音","慌张的路人","惊惧的路人","无措的路人","喘息的路人","焦急的忍者","星熊","森内","更纱","眼尖的工作人员","黑道和忍者们","心虚的黑道","为首的黑道"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_64_g14_mifuneoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireworks","volume":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"从电视台的顶层俯瞰，夜空中烟花零星升起，又缓缓下坠，一直落到脚下不可见的地方。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"花火大会尚未正式开始，这不过是预热之前的预热。","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"斐迪亚凝视着玻璃幕墙里的自己，和自己身后重铸后的般若。","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#4$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"……般若。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"二十年过去，你终于到了我的手里……可惜，太迟了。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"除了代替铁斋，被打扮成这次仪式的承认者以外，你又能为我做些什么呢？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"斐迪亚玩味地看着重铸后的般若，忽然注意到内面的把手上明显粘着胶痕，大概是被什么绑带箍了很长时间。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"内面没动过，是吗？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#2$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"……真是面好盾，但也就这样了。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#2$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"澪！","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clog_fts","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":28},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"1.5","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1.5","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"距离典礼正式开始还有多长时间？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"一个小时左右。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"行。我下楼透口气。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"三船先生，星熊很可能突袭会场。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我正等着她来呢。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"您是说？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"她来无非两种情况。要么已经被逼疯，要么居然还能在铁斋死后保持冷静。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"但不管她什么样，在我的地盘上，在我的镜头下，电视上的她，也不过是个疯狂的杀人鬼。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"到时候，这个疯女人就只会是这次继位仪式的注脚，陷入疯狂的失败者。就算我敌不过她，也会有上面的人来替我收拾她的。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"萌萌香她……","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"不忍心了？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"也罢，那就再留她一阵子，把她彻底榨干。我们有的是手段让她就范——","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"等等，这样也得留那个叫吉星的一条命，免得彻底让萌萌香绝望。你还没处理她呢吧？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"没有。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"那就好。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"对了，哲也呢？","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"澪？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……我没能看住他。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你？没能看住他？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"三船的声音陡然阴狠起来。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"说实话。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……我放跑了他。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"还是恻隐之心？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"是。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"仅此而已？","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"仅此而已。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我对你很失望。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"愿受惩罚。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"算了。现在正是用人之际，我先不跟你计较。不过，你的任务该变一变了。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"假如星熊真打了过来，你去对她。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"这是我分内之事。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"别急着答应。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"如果她活着走到了我面前，你该知道自己的下场是什么。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……是。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"从现在开始，时刻会有两名忍者盯住你。别想耍什么花招。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我出去透口气。告诉所有人，做好应对一切突发情况的准备。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_bg_64_g2_jindastreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firework_amb","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"f","id":108},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":112},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1912_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"1.5","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣喜的路人","text":"花火大会还有一会儿，现在只是预热。我们继续在这边逛一会儿吧。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1912_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的路人","text":"别，亲爱的，我们就该直接去河对面的花火大会会场。城际网络上好多人在说，这片区域现在不安全。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1912_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的路人","text":"有小道消息说金石会的会长死了。怪谈中的那个青鬼砍死了他。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1912_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣喜的路人","text":"欸——是那个传媒大亨，金什么来着？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1912_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的路人","text":"不是不是，那个是三船。死掉的是铁斋。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1912_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣喜的路人","text":"欸——我看平时都是三船出现，还以为是他死了呢。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1912_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的路人","text":"锻冶町那边好像也有些不好的消息，加上最近一直在传的北院间谍……总之，还是先去河对岸吧。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1912_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":137},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"charslot","id":141},{"type":"background","id":142},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_cg_firework.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":143},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":144},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firework_huge","volume":"1","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"怪谈。议题设置。舆论操作。","id":149},{"type":"text","text":"这一套流程，他已经熟悉到不能再熟悉了。","id":150},{"type":"text","text":"谁又能猜得到，御机一切怪谈的来源，不过是岛须拿议员候选人的事要挟自己，又死在自己刀下呢？","id":151},{"type":"text","text":"岛须的死需要掩盖，刚起步的电视台需要话题，刚刚搭上线的议员正等着看自己处事的手腕。","id":152},{"type":"text","text":"于是自己横下心，把星熊和新安芸市那个“沉默的佐原”杂糅起来，将所谓凶宅当成一整周的热门话题报道，结果一炮而红。","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"高强度的拍摄打消了看热闹的市民的疑心，又给自己留下了充足的善后和误导的空间。","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"怪谈带来的热度变成钱，钱打动了议员，禁锢了警察，让金石会对自己俯首帖耳，连铁斋也无从置喙。","id":155},{"type":"text","text":"在那之后，一切都一发不可收拾。凶宅成了绝佳的处理碍事之人的场所。","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"但这样的把戏不可能永远玩下去。兴趣会消退，收益会减少，与日俱增的，只会是铁斋的怀疑和舆论的压力。","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"于是，在最后一个知道议员候选人死因的组员被处理掉后，自己开始拓宽“怪谈”的范围和渠道。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"神明可以是怪谈，事故可以是怪谈，哪怕无事发生，只要有人愿意讲一个引人入胜又让人脊背发凉的故事，那也可以是怪谈。","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"自己曾经也疑惑过，御机的居民们，何以对怪谈趋之若鹜呢？","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"他们惧怕生活中任何可能的危险，却又难以收住好奇的视线，仿佛那点危险对他们有着致命的吸引力。","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"无论如何，电视台为金石会提供了源源不断的收入，反过来又拉动了晶体元件产业，让自己成了铁斋看不上，却又离不开的人。","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"而那时的铁斋对自己来说，已经只是一个……","id":163},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":165},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"image","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"……？！","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"紧急情况速报……","id":180},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_imprisonment_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_bat_imprisonment_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":182,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_64_i07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":185},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":186},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_064cg_alart","layer":"1","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":191},{"type":"subtitle","text":"紧急情况速报，紧急情况速报。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":192},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这不是演习，这不是演习。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":193},{"type":"subtitle","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的路人","text":"怎么回事？地震？！","id":196},{"type":"dialog","id":197},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"subtitle","text":"御机目前正遭到北院军队的全面攻击，御机目前正遭到北院军队的全面攻击。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":200},{"type":"subtitle","text":"为了您的人身安全，请遵守以下指示：","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":201},{"type":"subtitle","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊惧的路人","text":"北院军队入侵？怎么可能？！","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"subtitle","text":"请身处室内的市民立刻关闭门窗，关闭室内灯光，等待下一步指示。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":208},{"type":"subtitle","text":"请身处室外的市民前往距离您最近的避难设施，就近避难。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":209},{"type":"subtitle","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无措的路人","text":"避、避难设施？御机有过这种东西吗？","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喘息的路人","text":"以前据说是有过宣传的，现在、现在只能看着路上的标牌慢慢找了……","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"不仅仅是仁田街，整个御机的夜晚，除了对地面上的事情一无所知的烟火，忽然被密密麻麻的红光搅乱。","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"那是正在被遗忘的恐惧。","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"血峰战役之后，南北之间的冲突不减反增，但呼啸着发展的经济实在太过震耳欲聋，以至于人们对边境传来的炮火声越来越充耳不闻。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"即便到九十年代之后，无论御机还是锁川，都未放弃将对面作为假想敌的预案，但双方的民众却已彻底将这种可能抛到脑后。","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"终于，那被遗忘多年，却无人能置身事外的恐惧，比任何怪谈都更紧地攫住了御机市民的心，紧到几乎攥破。","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的忍者","text":"三船先生！","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"到底发生了什么？！","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的忍者","text":"有人黑入了金石台的播送网络，在政府发给我们备用的应急影像上动了手脚，还……还向全御机放了出来！","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的忍者","text":"那个人甚至通过我们难以辨别的技术手段间接控制了一部分其他电视台的播送网络，好几家友商也受到了影响。","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的忍者","text":"友商以为这是我们的官方行为，几乎要把我们的电话打爆了！","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"喂？现在究竟是什么情况——","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"议员大人？！","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"2","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"charslot","id":233},{"type":"bgeffect","id":234},{"type":"image","id":235},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_64_g17_jindaalley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"森内，你那边的潜入顺利吗？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"好得很，人群全乱了，电视台里的人进进出出，我很容易就混进去了。","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#5$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"更纱，稍微适可而止一点。这样的假消息可能会引发意想不到的后果。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"放心，我特意避开了花火大会之类人挤人的区域，还有医院学校养老院这种大家心脏承受力都不太好的地方。","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"而且警报播放几遍之后，就会播放一个声称刚刚只是误播的澄清视频啦。","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"我带着萌萌香和吉星先往继位仪式的会场去了。","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"星熊，闹出下一个大乱子的任务，就交给你了。","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"了解。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheelfts","volume":"1","id":256},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":257},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"charslot","id":261},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_bg_64_g2_jindastreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":264},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"10","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"星熊一路逆着混乱的人群，走向电视台的方向。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"正如更纱所说，大多数电视都开始放起了所谓的“澄清视频”，而惊魂未定的人群也渐渐冷静下来。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"赶路的途中，她其实想过，会不会从人群身上看到自己期待的反应。","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"不必是什么如梦初醒，或者居安思危一类沉重又讨人嫌的东西。","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"她只想看见一个寒战。一个切切实实地回想起恐惧为何物，而不是将其贬为幸福生活中的一点调剂的寒战。","id":273},{"type":"text","text":"但她只听见许多人兴高采烈地重复着一个词……","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"“怪谈”。","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_faceoff_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":277,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheelfts","volume":"1","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……到了。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"看来电视台真是彻底乱了套，门口的警备这么松懈吗？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"独角的鬼毫无踌躇地往楼内走去。她经过一个，两个，三个工作人员，没人注意到她。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"直到第四个人……","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"眼尖的工作人员","text":"青鬼？！","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"眼尖的工作人员","text":"青鬼！快叫金石会的人！","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":289},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1916_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,20","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,20","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":296},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":297},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1.5","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"各位还是给我让开一条路，这样比较稳妥。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1916_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道和忍者们","text":"……","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不走？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"尽管星熊被黑道和忍者重重包围，可在围着她的这些人心中，不知怎的，一股惧意始终萦绕不去，倒好像……","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"不是他们包围了她，而是她一个人把这里的所有人给包围了似的。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"如果哪位听说过二十年前，“金石会的青鬼”在御机做过什么，就该知道，我是为了你们好。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"哪怕各位和我已经不是手足，哪怕你们的老大……害死了铁斋叔，我仍然不想和你们交手。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"走吧，让我去见金兵卫。别逼我。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"心虚的黑道","text":"别、别以为你逃得掉！","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"心虚的黑道","text":"金石会从来没发过将你“破门”或者“绝缘”的通告，你现在仍然是金石会的一员！对我们动手，就是对自己的家人动手！","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……这话你们自己信吗？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"无人应答。","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"星熊若无其事地朝着楼内走去。","id":327},{"type":"dialog","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bldwhoosh","volume":"1","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metalcollar","volume":"0.5","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"她的身后没有脚步声，只传来了什么细小的东西破空的声音。","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"她没去看那到底是什么。无论那东西是匕首，是闪盘，是手里剑，甚至只是一把豆子，此时都已经不再重要。","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"匕首上的力道不足啊，简直让人觉得你不是在丢暗器，是在撒豆驱鬼了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"鬼出去，福进来，是不是？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"为首的黑道","text":"你要是能老老实实就范，我们的确可以撒点豆子了事。我们之间没有仇。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"没有仇？也许吧，不过，我那时候，锻冶町撒豆子的规矩可是反过来的。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我们当年喊的是，福出去……","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"鬼进门。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drawsword","volume":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"她拔刀出鞘。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"听闻过青鬼恶名的黑道们不由自主地向后退去，唯有一个看起来还算年轻的黑道上前一步，打算出这个极有可能要命的风头。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……很好。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.05","duration":"0.2","id":355},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"background","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"1","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tswordlight","volume":"1","id":363},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_hoshiguma_slash","rox":"0","roy":"0","roz":"180","layer":"1","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_bg_64_g2_jindastreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":370},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":372},{"type":"text","text":"没人看清独角的鬼究竟做了什么。他们只看见青色的光芒闪过，年轻黑道腿上多了一道鲜血淋漓的伤口，扑通一声摔倒在地。","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"为首的黑道","text":"别……别怕！弟兄们上！","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"为首的黑道","text":"我们是……我们是横行天下的金石会，都给我挺直了腰，给我上！不能给金石会，给三船会长丢脸！","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drawsword","volume":"1","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":379},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":380},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":382},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_audience_chaos","volume":"1","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"这还像点话。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"于是，人群像潮水一样涌向独自向前迈步的鬼。","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"而鬼只是一步又一步地向前走去，直到离面前的人近得不能再近——","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"青色的火光再次亮起，这次，所有人都看清了，那不再压抑愤怒的鬼的真正的身姿。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":395},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"6","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","volume":"1","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing3","volume":"1","id":408},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_heavy","volume":"1","id":414},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":415},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":416},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":417},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"长刀落下。","id":419},{"type":"text","text":"没有一个人真正受到了致命伤，却也没有一个人还能站得起来，只剩那个独角的鬼形影相吊。","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……可怜。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":425},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"background","id":430},{"type":"image","id":431}],"characters":["三船","澪","欣喜的路人","冷静的路人","电视里的声音","慌张的路人","惊惧的路人","无措的路人","喘息的路人","焦急的忍者","星熊","森内","更纱","眼尖的工作人员","黑道和忍者们","心虚的黑道","为首的黑道"]}